<figure id="S4.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>
Performance with different training budget (defined as the cost of several complete agent trajectories per prompt).
The base model is Qwen2.5-3b.
The best results are indicated in <span id="S4.T3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>.
</figcaption>
