<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Theoretical Analysis</h2>

<div id="A3.Thmassumption1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_assumption">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmassumption1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption C.1</span></span><span id="A3.Thmassumption1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Binary Preference Setting)</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For each intermediate tree node <math id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math>, the subsequent trajectory in terms of reward falls into two categories, denoted as <math id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">win</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">loss</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}</annotation></semantics></math>, with associated rewards </span>{<span id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">1,0</span>}<span id="A3.Thmassumption1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.
The trajectory probabilities are defined as</span></p>
<table id="A3.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})=1-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})=\prod_{\tau=t}^{T}\pi_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\tau}^{\text{win}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;\tau})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>τ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})=1-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})=\prod_{\tau=t}^{T}\pi_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\tau}^{\text{win}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;\tau}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">By the assumption, the probability of <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}</annotation></semantics></math> could be normalized within the binary set <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=\{\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=\{\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}\}</annotation></semantics></math> as:</p>
<table id="A3.E17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E17X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E17X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E17X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\prod_{\tau=t}^{T}\pi_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\tau}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;\tau})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∏</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>τ</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\prod_{\tau=t}^{T}\pi_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\tau}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;\tau})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="4" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E17Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E17Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|C,x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|C,x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E17Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E17Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}{{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}+e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}{{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}+e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E17Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E17Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma(\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}))," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma(\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p1.3" class="ltx_p">and the loss probability is:</p>
<table id="A3.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})=1-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})=\sigma(\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}))." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})=1-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})=\sigma(\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p2.2" class="ltx_p">For <span id="A3.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">step-level DPO</span>, the objective is to optimize Bradley-Terry preference likelihood by:</p>
<table id="A3.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{\text{DPO}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})\sim\mathcal{D}}\left[\log\sigma\left(\beta\Delta_{\theta}\left(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}\right)\right)\right]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>DPO</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\text{DPO}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})\sim\mathcal{D}}\left[\log\sigma\left(\beta\Delta_{\theta}\left(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}\right)\right)\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p2.3" class="ltx_p">where preference is defined by:</p>
<table id="A3.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}})=\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}})=\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p2.4" class="ltx_p">Let</p>
<table id="A3.E21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z=\beta\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z=\beta\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p2.5" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math> is a temperature parameter, and we assume <math id="A3.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=1</annotation></semantics></math> for simplicity.
Since DPO usually treats the expectation as the empirical average of the sampled pairs <math id="A3.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})</annotation></semantics></math>, the gradient of Eq. <a href="#A3.E19" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a> <math id="A3.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{\text{DPO}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>DPO</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\text{DPO}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math> can be directly put inside as:</p>
<table id="A3.E22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E22X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{DPO}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>DPO</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{DPO}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\nabla_{\theta}\log\sigma\left(\Delta_{\theta}\left(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}\right)\right)]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\nabla_{\theta}\log\sigma\left(\Delta_{\theta}\left(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t},\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}\right)\right)]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="13" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\nabla_{\theta}\log\sigma(z)]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}[\nabla_{\theta}\log\sigma(z)]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}z}\log\sigma(z)\cdot\nabla_{\theta}z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>z</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\mathrm{d}}{\mathrm{d}z}\log\sigma(z)\cdot\nabla_{\theta}z</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma(-z)\cdot\nabla_{\theta}z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>z</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma(-z)\cdot\nabla_{\theta}z</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma(-z)\cdot\nabla_{\theta}\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma(-z)\cdot\nabla_{\theta}\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xe" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xe.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma(-z)\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma(-z)\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xf" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xf.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma(-\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma(-\Delta_{\theta}(x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xg" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xg.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sigma(\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sigma(\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})-\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{win}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xh" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xh.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="4.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xi" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xi.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}{{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}+e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}{{e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}+e^{\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xj" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xj.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="4.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xk" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xk.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}^{\text{loss}}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E22Xl" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E22Xl.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{p(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})}_{\text{Weight}}\cdot\underbrace{\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})\right]}_{\text{Preference Advantage Gradient}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Weight</mtext></munder><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Preference Advantage Gradient</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{p(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})}_{\text{Weight}}\cdot\underbrace{\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})\right]}_{\text{Preference Advantage Gradient}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p3.3" class="ltx_p">For our <span id="A3.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">intra-tree group policy optimization</span>, the objective can be expressed as the combination of two categories <math id="A3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A3.E23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E23.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{\left[x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}\sim\pi_{\theta}\left(\cdot|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]}\frac{1}{G_{\text{tree}}}\sum_{i=1}^{G_{\text{tree}}}\left[\hat{A}_{\text{win}}+\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\right]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>Intra-tree</mtext></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mrow><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>]</mo></mrow></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>tree</mtext></msub></mfrac><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>tree</mtext></msub></munderover><mrow><mo>[</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)=\mathbb{E}_{\left[x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t},\mathcal{H}_{\geq t}\sim\pi_{\theta}\left(\cdot|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]}\frac{1}{G_{\text{tree}}}\sum_{i=1}^{G_{\text{tree}}}\left[\hat{A}_{\text{win}}+\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p3.4" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G_{\text{tree}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>G</mi><mtext>tree</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G_{\text{tree}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of leaves within the tree.
Then the gradient of Eq. <a href="#A3.E23" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">23</span></a> <math id="A3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>Intra-tree</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math> is:</p>
<table id="A3.E24" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E24X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E24X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>Intra-tree</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E24X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\approx\mathbb{E}\left[\hat{A}_{\text{win}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)+\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\approx\mathbb{E}\left[\hat{A}_{\text{win}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)+\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\right]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E24Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E24Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{win}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{win}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E24Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E24Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p3.5" class="ltx_p">The baseline <math id="A3.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math> could be estimated by probability-weighting as</p>
<table id="A3.E25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{base}}=1\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})+0\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{base}}=1\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})+0\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p3.6" class="ltx_p">Here we simply use the difference between <math id="A3.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{win/loss}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>win/loss</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{win/loss}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A3.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{\text{baseline}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{\text{baseline}}</annotation></semantics></math> to express the advantage estimate as:</p>
<table id="A3.E26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{A}_{\text{win}}=R_{\text{win}}-R_{\text{base}}=1-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}),\ \hat{A}_{\text{loss}}=R_{\text{loss}}-R_{\text{base}}=-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{A}_{\text{win}}=R_{\text{win}}-R_{\text{base}}=1-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}),\ \hat{A}_{\text{loss}}=R_{\text{loss}}-R_{\text{base}}=-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p3.7" class="ltx_p">Combining Eq. <a href="#A3.E17" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>, Eq. <a href="#A3.E18" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, Eq. <a href="#A3.E24" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">24</span></a>, and Eq. <a href="#A3.E26" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">26</span></a>, the gradient of intra-tree group policy optimization can be reformulated as</p>
<table id="A3.E27" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E27X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext>Intra-tree</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{Intra-tree}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{win}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{win}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="5" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E27Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>loss</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)\hat{A}_{\text{loss}}\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E27Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E27Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>p</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})\cdot\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E27Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E27Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\underbrace{p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})}_{\text{Weight}}\cdot\underbrace{\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})\right]}_{\text{Preference Advantage Gradient}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Weight</mtext></munder><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>win</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext>loss</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>Preference Advantage Gradient</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\underbrace{p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})}_{\text{Weight}}\cdot\underbrace{\left[\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t})-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t})\right]}_{\text{Preference Advantage Gradient}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">From Eq. <a href="#A3.E22" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a> and Eq. <a href="#A3.E27" title="In Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">27</span></a>, we can have the following Proposition <a href="#A3.Thmproposition1" title="Proposition C.1 (Structural Equivalence of step-level DPO and Intra-tree GRPO) ‣ Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.Thmproposition1" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_proposition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="A3.Thmproposition1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proposition C.1</span></span><span id="A3.Thmproposition1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Structural Equivalence of step-level DPO and Intra-tree GRPO)</span></h6>
<div id="A3.Thmproposition1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.Thmproposition1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmproposition1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under Assumption <a href="#A3.Thmassumption1" title="Assumption C.1 (Binary Preference Setting) ‣ Appendix C Theoretical Analysis ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a>, both step-level DPO and intra-tree GRPO admit gradient estimators of the form</span></p>
<table id="A3.E28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A3.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{unified}}(\theta)\;=\;\underbrace{w}_{\text{Weight}}\cdot\underbrace{\left(\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}\right)\right)}_{\text{Preference Advantage Gradient}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>J</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">unified</mtext></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Weight</mtext></munder><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">win</mtext></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">loss</mtext></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Preference Advantage Gradient</mtext></munder></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\theta}J_{\text{unified}}(\theta)\;=\;\underbrace{w}_{\text{Weight}}\cdot\underbrace{\left(\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{win}}_{\geq t}\right)-\nabla_{\theta}\log p_{\theta}\left(\mathcal{H}^{\text{loss}}_{\geq t}\right)\right)}_{\text{Preference Advantage Gradient}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.Thmproposition1.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.Thmproposition1.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where the only difference lies in the choice of the weight term <math id="A3.Thmproposition1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>w</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Algorithm Workflow of Tree-GRPO</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The complete Tree-GRPO procedure is detailed in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="In Appendix D Algorithm Workflow of Tree-GRPO ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>Tree-based Group Relative Policy Optimization</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Policy model <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, search environment <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>e</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e</annotation></semantics></math>, dataset <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>, hyperparameters <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M,N,L" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M,N,L</annotation></semantics></math>, maximum action budget <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Procedure</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.2.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_typewriter">GenerateRollout(<em id="algorithm1.4.2.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_serif ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{\text{prefix}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">prefix</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{\text{prefix}}</annotation></semantics></math></em>)</em>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">This procedure completes a trajectory from a prefix </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{H}_{\text{prefix}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>prefix</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{H}_{\text{prefix}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b\leftarrow\text{budget of existing prefix}\mathcal{H}_{\text{prefix}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>budget of existing prefix</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mtext>prefix</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b\leftarrow\text{budget of existing prefix}\mathcal{H}_{\text{prefix}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.6.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b&lt;B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b&lt;B</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Generate <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}\sim\pi_{\theta}(\cdot|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}\sim\pi_{\theta}(\cdot|x,\mathcal{H}_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{H}+\mathcal{H}_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{H}+\mathcal{H}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.9.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y_{t}=\textnormal{{\color[rgb]{0.0117,0.7148,0.9141}&lt;/search&gt;}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#03B6E9;" mathcolor="#03B6E9">&lt;/search&gt;</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y_{t}=\textnormal{{\color[rgb]{0.0117,0.7148,0.9141}&lt;/search&gt;}}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Parse last action <math id="algorithm1.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q\leftarrow\text{Parse}(y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Parse</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q\leftarrow\text{Parse}(y)</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Observation <math id="algorithm1.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o\leftarrow e(q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o\leftarrow e(q)</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <math id="algorithm1.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{H}+\text{{\color[rgb]{0.7695,0.4336,0.25}&lt;information&gt;}}o\text{{\color[rgb]{0.7695,0.4336,0.25}&lt;/information&gt;}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#C46F40;" mathcolor="#C46F40">&lt;information&gt;</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#C46F40;" mathcolor="#C46F40">&lt;/information&gt;</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{H}+\text{{\color[rgb]{0.7695,0.4336,0.25}&lt;information&gt;}}o\text{{\color[rgb]{0.7695,0.4336,0.25}&lt;/information&gt;}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else if</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.13.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}_{t}\in\{\textnormal{{\color[rgb]{0.793,0.0117,0.2266}&lt;/answer&gt;}},\textnormal{&lt;eos&gt;}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext style="--ltx-fg-color:#CA033A;" mathcolor="#CA033A">&lt;/answer&gt;</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>&lt;eos&gt;</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}_{t}\in\{\textnormal{{\color[rgb]{0.793,0.0117,0.2266}&lt;/answer&gt;}},\textnormal{&lt;eos&gt;}\}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.15.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{H}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{H}</annotation></semantics></math></em>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.16" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">/* </span><span id="algorithm1.4.16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Main algorithm logic starts here  */</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.17" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.17.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{step}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">step</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{step}=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.17.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm1.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{\text{total}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">total</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.18" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Reference model <math id="algorithm1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\text{ref}}\leftarrow\pi_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\text{ref}}\leftarrow\pi_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.19" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> Training data <math id="algorithm1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x,\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}_{\text{step}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℋ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mtext>step</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x,\mathcal{H}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}_{\text{step}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.20" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm1.4.20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Step <a href="#S3.I1.i1" title="item 1 ‣ 3.1 Tree Search for Agent Rollout ‣ 3 Tree-based Group Relative Policy Optimization (Tree-GRPO) ‣ Tree Search for LLM Agent Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>: Generate independent chains for initial <math id="algorithm1.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> trees </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.21" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm1.4.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.21.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm1.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm1.4.21.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm1.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
